      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# \ud83e\udde9 ZMongo Content Pack V3 \u2014 Create + Static Export Demo\n\nThis workflow demonstrates both steps in one canvas:\n\n1. **Create a V3 content pack** from JSON values.\n2. **Add an IMAGE** from ComfyUI `LoadImage` into the same content pack.\n3. **Export the completed content pack** as a self-contained static workflow JSON.\n\n## Run steps\n\n1. Select an image in the `00 Load Image` node.\n2. Run the workflow.\n3. The `ZMongo Content Pack Export Static Workflow V3` node should trigger the browser download helper.\n4. Open the downloaded `.workflow.json`; it should contain only restored value outputs, such as `message`, `seed`, `guidance_scale`, and `hero_image`.\n\nNo aliases, alias indices, manifest, or success outputs are exported into the static node."
      ],
      "title": "\ud83d\udcd8 README: Create Content Pack + Export Static Workflow",
      "color": "#232",
      "bgcolor": "#353"
    },
